# {{module}}

An [Airway](https://github.com/daqing/airway) engine.

## Develop

```bash
go get github.com/daqing/airway@latest
go mod tidy
```

## Use in a host application

```bash
go get {{module}}
```

Then enable it with a blank import in the host's `engines.go`:

```go
import (
	_ "{{module}}"
)
```

The engine mounts its routes at `/api/v1/{{engine}}`. To ship SQL migrations,
add `<version>_<name>.up.sql` / `.down.sql` files under `db/migrate/`, expose
them with `engine.MigrationProvider`, and install them in the host with
`go run . engine:install {{engine}}`.

See https://github.com/daqing/airway/blob/main/docs/engine.md for the full
engine guide.
